{"3750070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marimo-VS-IAS: Our Friends", "steam_appid": 3750070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5194550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For our friends</strong>――</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/fa1501055d2a62c916bdbc17254b2f0e.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D action game where marimo (lake balls) in Lake Akan—now part of the sea—fight for survival against various invasive alien species!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of actions, mow down your enemies, and save your friend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Overview ●</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Marimo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your marimo and wipe out the threats closing in on the Marimo――</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based game mode.<br>Take on around 60 different missions, including defeating enemies, sabotaging their operations, and rescuing or defending your allies.<br>Challenge the hard-mode versions of each mission and aim to become the ultimate marimo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/cb221a9c6a0c88a09b195d7197767df3.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marimo Upgrades</strong><br>Customize your marimo’s abilities freely using items obtained from rewards and exploration!<br>Adapting your upgrades to each situation is the key to overcoming powerful enemies and high-difficulty missions...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/7b8173772ed5a79b14afe70bc7ed2239.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Exploration</strong> <br>Freely explore the lake to discover hidden items, information, side quests, and lurking dangers. <br>The environment may even change as the story progresses…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/42f9a372385666408b9b2f4f03784e02.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training missions to help you get stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're not used to action games, you're welcome!<br>A training mode where you can learn the controls and rules while earning upgrade items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/43f38dba6530e1b3f1c953ae8e43bbd4.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery in an Optional Sub-Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did the Marimo survive in waters where the environment changed so drastically?<br>How did the lake end up becoming part of the sea?<br>Explore the lake and uncover the truth!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/5400703ff84789f4e0d527cf748a4131.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Story ●</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The marimo of Lake Akan once lived peaceful lives.<br>However, rising water temperatures and a lack of sunlight drastically reduced their numbers. With help from humans, they recovered and began to thrive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after many years, the lake suddenly turned into seawater, wiping out much of its ecosystem. Invading species from the sea threatened the survivors, pushing the marimo to the brink of extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, mysterious glowing particles appeared underwater, driving creatures into a frenzy… and granting new power to the remaining marimo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This story shares the same world and timeline as the previous title, &quot;<strong>Marimo-VS-IAS</strong>,&quot; but can be fully enjoyed on its own.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For our friends</strong>――</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750070/extras/fa1501055d2a62c916bdbc17254b2f0e.avif?t=1788310429\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D action game where marimo (lake balls) in Lake Akan—now part of the sea—fight for survival against various invasive alien species!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of actions, mow down your enemies, and save your friend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Overview ●</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Marimo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your marimo and wipe out the threats closing in on the Marimo――</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra